der', 'Hungry Spriggan', 'Inquisition of Kozilek', 'Intangible Virtue', 'Izzet Charm', 'Izzet Guildgate', 'Izzet Signet', 'Jungle Shrine', 'Kathari Bomber', 'Kor Hookmaster', 'Kor Skyfisher', 'Kraken Hatchling', 'Liliana of the Veil', 'Lingering Souls', 'Linvala, Keeper of Silence', 'Lone Missionary', 'Madcap Skills', 'Magma Jet', 'Marsh Flats', 'Master Splicer', 'Might of Old Krosa', 'Mind Shatter', 'Mist Raven', 'Mistmeadow Witch', 'Misty Rainforest', 'Mizzium Mortars', 'Mogg Flunkies', 'Molten Rain', 'Momentary Blink', 'Moroii', 'Mortician Beetle', 'Mudbutton Torchrunner', 'Mystic Genesis', 'Mystical Teachings', 'Night Terrors', 'Niv-Mizzet, Dracogenius', 'Obzedat, Ghost Council', 'Ogre Jailbreaker', 'Olivia Voldaren', 'Opportunity', 'Orzhov Guildgate', 'Orzhov Signet', 'Past in Flames', 'Path to Exile', 'Penumbra Spider', 'Phantasmal Image', 'Pilfered Plans', 'Pit Keeper', 'Pitfall Trap', 'Primal Command', 'Putrefy', 'Pyrewild Shaman', 'Pyroclasm', 'Pyromancer Ascension', 'Rakdos Guildgate', 'Rakdos Signet', 'Ranger of Eos', 'Recover', 'Restoration Angel', 'Revive', 'Rewind', 'Rhox War Monk', 'Rootborn Defenses', 'Rubblebelt Maaka', 'Savage Lands', 'Scalding Tarn', 'Scavenging Ooze', 'Scorched Rusalka', 'Scourge Devil', 'Sea Gate Oracle', 'Seal of Doom', 'Seal of Primordium', 'Seaside Citadel', 'Sedraxis Specter', 'Selesnya Guildgate', 'Selesnya Signet', 'Sensor Splicer', 'Serum Visions', 'Sever the Bloodline', 'Shimmering Grotto', 'Simic Guildgate', 'Simic Signet', 'Simic Sky Swallower', 'Sin Collector', 'Skirsdag Cultist', 'Skyknight Legionnaire', 'Slaughterhorn', 'Slime Molding', 'Snapcaster Mage', 'Soul Manipulation', 'Soul Ransom', 'Soul Warden', 'Spell Pierce', "Sphinx's Revelation", 'Spike Jester', 'Spire Monitor', 'Sprouting Thrinax', 'Stoic Angel', 'Stony Silence', 'Strength in Numbers', 'Summoning Trap', 'Sundering Growth', 'Sunhome Guildmage', 'Sylvan Ranger', 'Séance', 'Talon Trooper', 'Tandem Lookout', 'Tarmogoyf', 'Tattermunge Witch', 'Teleportal', 'Temporal Mastery', 'Terminate', 'Terminus', 'Thornscape Battlemage', 'Thragtusk', 'Thunderous Wrath', 'Thundersong Trumpeter', 'Torrent of Souls', 'Tower Gargoyle', 'Traitorous Instinct', 'Ulvenwald Tracker', 'Unburial Rites', 'Unflinching Courage', 'Urban Evolution', 'Urbis Protector', 'Vampire Aristocrat', 'Vampire Nighthawk', 'Vanish into Memory', 'Venser, Shaper Savant', 'Verdant Catacombs', 'Vital Splicer', 'Vithian Stinger', 'Voice of Resurgence', 'Wake the Reflections', 'Wall of Denial', 'Wall of Frost', 'Wayfaring Temple', 'Wing Splicer', 'Wingcrafter', 'Woolly Thoctar', 'Wort, the Raidmother', 'Youthful Knight', 'Zealous Conscripts', 'Zur the Enchanter']
